  "body": "Construction Complete - Photography Pending \r\n\r\nThree exclusive architectural homes, ensconced on the beachfront of one of Auckland's most desirable suburbs. These homes are  waterfront across the road from Kohimarama Beach. Thoughtfully designed by Cheshire Architects, a tonal, textural materiality reflects the beachfront location, with a modern design sensibility that exquisitely captures the duality of this unique location.  \r\n\r\nOne foot on the beach and one in the city, at Beachhouse, one is within easy reach of Auckland's urban attractions, yet positioned to partake of a lifestyle in tune with the tides and rhythms of nature. With water views framed by Pohutukawa, each home occupies an entire level of the structure, each dwelling offering a vantage unto itself, to present three distinct opportunities to make this lifestyle your own. \r\n\r\nAppointed with luxury Molteni&C kitchens and wardrobes, carefully selected interior finishes and bespoke furniture accents, these exquisite homes offer spaces of quiet reflection and connected living, with a seamless connection to the outside environment and a thoughtful approach to the daily fluidity of life from moment to moment.\r\n\r\nTo explore visit www.beachhouse.nz",
